\fIRelationshipProperty\fP \%<https://\:docs\:.sqlalchemy\:.org/\:en/\:20/\:orm/\:internals\:.html#\:sqlalchemy\:.orm\:.RelationshipProperty>[\fIAny\fP \%<https://\:docs\:.python\:.org/\:3/\:library/\:typing\:.html#\:typing\:.Any>]
